{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "001942f406f182fba6bf60d1dd2a282018bb240a6d47f8ef1eca90078dd2f504", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nその、先日の仕事の件なんですが……。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n那个，关于前几天的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f87178add08742a344eec71b53267eb34ac3bd05d33cca001e09dcb04347ca24", "ja": "先日の？　ええと、どの仕事のことだ？", "zh": "前几天的？呃，你是指哪份工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "ed2c19826a8efe6b943ef2150e0dddcc5ed5c11236e4f00a9bc23daaaa994c8a", "ja": "ですから、CMの……。\nメイドの。", "zh": "就是广告的……\n女仆的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0facdf7c67568d42649941f7265b27e84f2ca82071ca50fc4fd0ccce84562f88", "ja": "ああ、あれか！　ファンにも大好評で、\nなかなかの反響だったよな。", "zh": "喔，你说那个啊！在粉丝之间也大受好评，\n引起了热烈回响呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "b90c2cfb4f207e5d96c3ef108a301b0f0e88214d9925c76c4ca60fe0ba67e25f", "ja": "そ、そうですね。新人のころに比べれば、その……\nああいう衣装にも慣れてきた、とは思います。", "zh": "是、是呀。跟新人时期相比，那个……\n我想我已经渐渐习惯那种服装了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "fe97c123672f58ddf719a1c753102d1f62b36e79d7e49b2eb36f173bd85e1fa0", "ja": "ですが、やはり私には、あまり向いていないような……\nその、仕事をいただけるのは、ありがたいのですが。", "zh": "只不过，我还是认为自己不太适合……\n那个，虽说能获得工作机会的确很令人感激……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c7f111413ab6e4e7af13e4d38dd6d517b40c42cfc8b3f660d359a56c133e6cb7", "ja": "そうか。\n……実はここに、その時の衣装がある。", "zh": "这样啊……\n其实那时的服装就收在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "45630b54395a3beb20331d5e1f942ac50e5e41a5a9264c0a6292e0df0908cb33", "ja": "えっ？　……何故？", "zh": "咦……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ef9f4a9cc6eb646292b475c36c66352a2229275bca9b005aeee9becb82e94df8", "ja": "千早の可能性を広げるため、こういう服に慣れてもらい\nたいんだ。今度、これを着てステージに……。", "zh": "为了拓展千早的可能性，我想让你习惯这种服装。\n下次就请你穿着这件登上舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0032_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "8e0a1d422d3d5f286ca03ee74d777ef5116827329c07e08fac9bf5836a24d352", "ja": "お、お断りします！　……{$P$}！\nそんな顔しても、ダメなものはダメです！", "zh": "我、我拒绝……{$P$}！\n就算你摆出那种表情，不行的事就是不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
